Error [jet.InvalidOverflowOptIn]: `wrapping` must wrap a single integer `+`, `-`, `*`, or `/`, or one narrowing conversion
  --> tests/ui/overflow_optin_misuse.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(wrapping(x))
    |           ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The overflow opt-ins apply to one arithmetic operation on whole numbers, or to one conversion to a fixed width that can't hold every value of its source
 Fix: Write it around one operation or conversion, e.g. `wrapping(a + b)` or `wrapping(U8{count})`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1005
